    <briefdescription>
<para>Unit tests for <ref refid="class_h_s_m_key_provider_adapter" kindref="compound">HSMKeyProviderAdapter</ref> WrapDEKFn/UnwrapDEKFn bridge (STUB #47 / #48). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
